				<div class='col-lg-4 paddingLeftNone' id='manifestDesc'>
					<div class='card'>
						<div class='card-body'>
							
			
			<h2>BioGRID Release Archive</h2>
			<p>This download directory contains BioGRID releases that have been retired and are no longer representative of the most recent state
			of our curated interaction set. If you are starting
			a new project using our data, it is <strong>HIGHLY</strong> recommended that you <span class="warning">NOT</span> use these data files as they
			are not the most up to date version of our interaction dataset. The best dataset to use is in the <strong>CURRENT RELEASE</strong> directory.</p>
			<br />
			<p><span class="warning">Warning</span>: This directory contains interaction datasets from an OLD build of the BioGRID and is now retired. 
			The BioGRID is a constantly evolving resource and this build is no longer supported. This build may contain interactions that are incorrect,
			deprecated, and obsolete. This dataset is to be used for <span class="warning">LEGACY PURPOSES ONLY</span>.</p>
		
	
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</section>
